  id: Spleen
  partName: Spleen
  descriptionChunks:
  - The spleen is an organ involved in filtering blood and supporting the immune
    system. It removes old or damaged red blood cells and helps fight infections.
  - The spleen also stores blood and contributes to immune responses. Its function
    is essential for maintaining healthy blood composition and protecting the body
    against disease.
